# Generation pod environment, pre-declared fallback pin set "fallback-bnb" (decision 24/09): bitsandbytes 0.49.2,
# the version in vLLM's documentation. NF4 bit-identity with training's 0.50.2 is not proven; the canary's
# hf_agreement gate measures the end-to-end effect.
# Chosen ONLY at the canary (KIND=gen GEN_SET=fallback-bnb bash ops/pod_bootstrap.sh), then fixed for the whole
# run: every job names it (--pin-set fallback-bnb). Resolves for x86_64-manylinux_2_28, Python 3.12 (uv pip
# compile). These pins equal v2gpu.engines.PIN_SETS["fallback-bnb"] (tested).
